#: src/reference/reference/command.md:6
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:9
msgid ""
"This page covers commands in detail. See [Command basics](../concepts/"
"command-basics.md) for a general explanation."
msgstr ""
"本页详细介绍命令。一般说明请参阅[命令基础](../concepts/command-basics.md)。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:11
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:13
msgid ""
"A _command_ is a system-level building block of sbt, often used to capture "
"user interactions. At the command level, there is little support for "
"subprojects and parallel processing since those are implemented in the `act` "
"command."
msgstr ""
"**命令**是 sbt 的系统级构建块，常用于捕获用户交互。在命令层面，对子项目和并行处理的支持很少，"
"因为这些由 `act` 命令实现。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:15
msgid ""
"Plugin authors should try to solve their problem using settings, tasks, and "
"input tasks first. Several notable exceptions are:"
msgstr ""
"插件作者应优先尝试用设置、任务和输入任务解决问题。若干值得注意的例外包括："

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:17
msgid "Extending the user experience of sbt itself"
msgstr ""
"扩展 sbt 自身的用户体验"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:18
msgid "Providing sequential processing, for example for `release` command"
msgstr ""
"提供顺序处理，例如 `release` 命令"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:20
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:22
msgid "There are three main aspects to commands:"
msgstr ""
"命令主要有三个方面："

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:24
msgid "The syntax used by the user to invoke the command, including:"
msgstr ""
"用户调用命令时使用的语法，包括："

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:25
msgid "Tab completion for the syntax"
msgstr ""
"语法的 Tab 补全"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:26
msgid "The parser to turn input into an appropriate data structure"
msgstr ""
"将输入转换为适当数据结构的解析器"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:27
msgid ""
"The action to perform using the parsed data structure. This action "
"transforms the build `State`."
msgstr ""
"使用解析后的数据结构执行的操作。该操作会转换构建 `State`"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:29
msgid "Help provided to the user"
msgstr ""
"向用户提供的帮助"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:31
msgid ""
"In sbt, the syntax part, including tab completion, is specified with parser "
"combinators. If you are familiar with the parser combinators in Scala's "
"standard library, these are very similar. See the [Tab-completion parser](./"
"tab-completion-parser.md) page for how to use the parser combinators."
msgstr ""
"在 sbt 中，语法部分（包括 Tab 补全）由解析器组合子指定。若您熟悉 Scala 标准库中的解析器组合子，"
"二者非常相似。解析器组合子的用法请参阅 [Tab 补全解析器](./tab-completion-parser.md)。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:38
msgid ""
"State provides access to the build state, such as all registered commands, "
"the remaining commands to execute, and all project-related information."
msgstr ""
"State 提供对构建状态的访问，例如所有已注册命令、待执行命令以及所有与项目相关的信息。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:47
msgid ""
"Finally, basic help information may be provided that is used by the `help` "
"command to display command help."
msgstr ""
"最后，可提供由 `help` 命令用于显示命令帮助的基本帮助信息。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:50
msgid "Defining a Command"
msgstr "定义命令"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:52
msgid ""
"A command combines a function `State => Parser[T]` with an action `(State, "
"T) => State`. The reason for `State => Parser[T]` and not simply `Parser[T]` "
"is that often the current `State` is used to build the parser. For example, "
"the currently loaded projects (provided by `State`) determine valid "
"completions for the `project` command. Examples for the general and specific "
"cases are shown in the following sections."
msgstr ""
"命令将函数 `State => Parser[T]` 与操作 `(State, T) => State` 组合。使用 `State => Parser[T]` "
"而非单纯的 `Parser[T]`，是因为通常需要用当前 `State` 构建解析器。例如，当前已加载的项目（由 `State` 提供）"
"决定 `project` 命令的有效补全。一般与具体情况的示例见以下各节。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:59
msgid ""
"See [Command.scala](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/blob/develop/main-command/src/"
"main/scala/sbt/Command.scala) for the source API details for constructing "
"commands."
msgstr ""
"构建命令的源码 API 详情请参阅 [Command.scala](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/blob/develop/main-command/src/main/scala/sbt/Command.scala)。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:62
msgid "General commands"
msgstr "一般命令"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:64
msgid "General command construction looks like:"
msgstr ""
"一般命令的构造如下："

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:69 src/reference/reference/command.md:79
#: src/reference/reference/command.md:90 src/reference/reference/command.md:102
msgid "\"name\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:72
msgid "No-argument commands"
msgstr "无参数命令"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:74
msgid ""
"There is a convenience method for constructing commands that do not accept "
"any arguments."
msgstr ""
"构造不接受任何参数的命令时有便捷方法。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:82
msgid "Single-argument command"
msgstr "单参数命令"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:84
msgid ""
"There is a convenience method for constructing commands that accept a single "
"argument with arbitrary content."
msgstr ""
"构造接受单个任意内容参数的命令时有便捷方法。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:88
msgid "// accepts the state and the single argument"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:93
msgid "Multi-argument command"
msgstr "多参数命令"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:95
msgid ""
"There is a convenience method for constructing commands that accept multiple "
"arguments separated by spaces."
msgstr ""
"构造接受空格分隔的多个参数的命令时有便捷方法。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:100
msgid "// <arg> is the suggestion printed for tab completion on an argument"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:102
msgid "\"<arg>\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:105
msgid "Full Example"
msgstr "完整示例"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:107
msgid ""
"The following example is a sample build that adds commands to a project. To "
"try it out:"
msgstr ""
"以下示例是在项目中添加命令的示例构建。可按下列步骤试用："

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:110
msgid "Create `build.sbt` and `project/CommandExample.scala`."
msgstr ""
"创建 `build.sbt` 和 `project/CommandExample.scala`。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:111
msgid "Run sbt on the project."
msgstr ""
"在该项目上运行 sbt。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:112
msgid ""
"Try out the `hello`, `helloAll`, `failIfTrue`, `color`, and printState "
"commands."
msgstr ""
"试用 `hello`、`helloAll`、`failIfTrue`、`color` 和 `printState` 命令。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:114
msgid "Use tab-completion and the code below as guidance."
msgstr ""
"可结合 Tab 补全与下方代码进行尝试。"

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:116
msgid "Here's `build.sbt`:"
msgstr ""
"以下为 `build.sbt`："

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:118
msgid ""
"````admonish example title=\"build.sbt\"\n"
"\n"
"```scala\n"
"import CommandExample.*\n"
"\n"
"scalaVersion := \"3.8.2\"\n"
"LocalRootProject / commands ++= Seq(hello, helloAll, failIfTrue, "
"changeColor, printState)\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:128
msgid "Here's `project/CommandExample.scala`:"
msgstr ""
"以下为 `project/CommandExample.scala`："

#: src/reference/reference/command.md:130
msgid ""
"````admonish example title=\"project/CommandExample.scala\"\n"
"\n"
"```scala\n"
"import sbt.*\n"
"import Keys.*\n"
"import scala.Console\n"
"\n"
"// imports standard command parsing functionality\n"
"import complete.DefaultParsers.*\n"
"\n"
"object CommandExample:\n"
"  // A simple, no-argument command that prints \"Hi\",\n"
"  //  leaving the current state unchanged.\n"
"  def hello = Command.command(\"hello\"): s0 =>\n"
"    Console.out.println(\"Hi!\")\n"
"    s0\n"
"\n"
"  // A simple, multiple-argument command that prints \"Hi\" followed by the "
"arguments.\n"
"  //   Again, it leaves the current state unchanged.\n"
"  def helloAll = Command.args(\"helloAll\", \"<name>\"): (s0, args) =>\n"
"    println(\"Hi \" + args.mkString(\" \"))\n"
"    s0\n"
"\n"
"  // A command that demonstrates failing or succeeding based on the input\n"
"  def failIfTrue = Command.single(\"failIfTrue\"):\n"
"    case (s0, \"true\") => s0.fail\n"
"    case (s0, _)      => s0\n"
"\n"
"  // Demonstration of a custom parser.\n"
"  // The command changes the foreground or background terminal color\n"
"  //  according to the input.\n"
"  lazy val change = Space ~> (reset | setColor)\n"
"  lazy val reset = token(\"reset\" ^^^ Console.RESET)\n"
"  lazy val color = token( Space ~> (\"blue\" ^^^ \"4\" | \"green\" ^^^ "
"\"2\") )\n"
"  lazy val select = token( \"fg\" ^^^ \"3\" | \"bg\" ^^^ \"4\" )\n"
"  lazy val setColor = (select ~ color).map: (g, c) =>\n"
"    s\"\\u001B[${g}${c}m\"\n"
"\n"
"  def changeColor = Command(\"color\")(_ => change): (s0, ansicode) =>\n"
"    Console.out.print(ansicode)\n"
"    Console.out.println(\"Hi\")\n"
"    s0\n"
"\n"
"  // A command that demonstrates getting information out of State.\n"
"  def printState = Command.command(\"printState\"): s0 =>\n"
"    import s0.*\n"
"    println(s\"definedCommands.size registered commands\")\n"
"    println(s\"commands to run: ${show(remainingCommands)}\")\n"
"    println()\n"
"\n"
"    println(s\"original arguments: ${show(configuration.arguments.toSeq)}"
"\")\n"
"    println(s\"base directory: ${configuration.baseDirectory}\")\n"
"    println()\n"
"\n"
"    println(s\"sbt version: ${configuration.provider.id.version}\")\n"
"    println(s\"Scala version (for sbt): $"
"{configuration.provider.scalaProvider.version}\")\n"
"    println()\n"
"\n"
"    val extracted = Project.extract(s0)\n"
"    import extracted.*\n"
"    println(s\"Current build: ${currentRef.build}\")\n"
"    println(s\"Current project: ${currentRef.project}\")\n"
"    println(s\"Original setting count: ${session.original.size}\")\n"
"    println(s\"Session setting count: ${session.append.size}\")\n"
"    s0\n"
"\n"
"  def show[A1](s: Seq[A1]) =\n"
"    s.map(\"'\" + _ + \"'\").mkString(\"[\", \", \", \"]\")\n"
"\n"
"end CommandExample\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""
